Section 2 — torch.profiler Live Demo
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

CONCEPT: torch.profiler records CPU ops AND CUDA kernels together.
  Use record_function() to annotate your own regions.
  Sort by self_cuda_time_total to find the real hotspot.

